section.prose:
Current state: the run half landed mid-triage as commit ddb86c2 (syntax-only; ordinary
let p = v;
unchanged), closing gandr-55v with residuals on gandr-6re. The remainder is minted: gandr-07e (val half) and gandr-wu4 (annotation lane), with the family linkage recorded on gandr-6re. F3 (gandr-wvd.24.4) and F4 (gandr-wvd.24.5) are unaffected in scope; the rename family is sequenced after F4 so the corpus-regeneration harness proves lowering-invariance — a discipline the run-half landing skipped by landing syntax-first ahead of F4, leaving its byte-identity verification in gandr-6re's OTHER face.
